    <string name="settings_pay_crypto_help">Use this only if you already have USDT. If you pay by card, skip this section.\n\nWhat to do:\n1) Copy the address below.\n2) In your wallet choose TRC20 (TRON) only — not ERC20 or BEP20.\n3) Send the exact amount: %1$s %2$s (%3$s).\n4) A smaller amount or a different coin will not count and cannot be refunded.\n5) Keep the app open until the timer ends (usually 1–15 minutes). The subscription turns on by itself.</string>
